    "detailed_description": "<strong>Plague Architect is a strategic outbreak simulator set in a mall.</strong> Inspired by classics like Plague Inc., but on the microscale.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Craft Your Plague</strong><br>Shape the disease by evolving traits, from how fast it spreads to how it changes shopper behavior - making them hungrier, slower, or more panicked.<br><br></li><li><strong>Control Behavior</strong><br>Watch hundreds of shoppers move, eat, and react in a living mall. Your choices influence their behavior.<br><br></li><li><strong>Watch Chaos Unfold</strong><br>Every game plays out differently. Shoppers may barricade zones, panic and scatter, or overwhelm responders. Adapt to random events that change the direction of the outbreak.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Development</h2>The game is currently in early development. I'm a solo developer working on a vertical slice to nail down the core gameplay experience: one mall, one disease type, and a limited set of features. Once this feels great to play, I'll share a development roadmap, including more disease types, scenarios, and long-term gameplay variety.<br><br>If you're interested in playtesting early builds, join the Discord!",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Plague Architect is a strategic outbreak simulator set in a mall.</strong> Inspired by classics like Plague Inc., but on the microscale.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Craft Your Plague</strong><br>Shape the disease by evolving traits, from how fast it spreads to how it changes shopper behavior - making them hungrier, slower, or more panicked.<br><br></li><li><strong>Control Behavior</strong><br>Watch hundreds of shoppers move, eat, and react in a living mall. Your choices influence their behavior.<br><br></li><li><strong>Watch Chaos Unfold</strong><br>Every game plays out differently. Shoppers may barricade zones, panic and scatter, or overwhelm responders. Adapt to random events that change the direction of the outbreak.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Development</h2>The game is currently in early development. I'm a solo developer working on a vertical slice to nail down the core gameplay experience: one mall, one disease type, and a limited set of features. Once this feels great to play, I'll share a development roadmap, including more disease types, scenarios, and long-term gameplay variety.<br><br>If you're interested in playtesting early builds, join the Discord!",
